Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 48/66] drm/msm/a5xx: Always set an OPP supported hardware value
Date:   Sat, 11 Apr 2020 19:11:45 -0400
Message-Id: <20200411231203.25933-48-sashal@kernel.org>
